{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "7f88e14b-51dc-4962-bf23-8ccb9de0f0d2",
    "name": "Wedding Invitation - Personalized RSVP System API",
    "description": "API collection for Chandrika & Xudong's Royal Wedding Personalized RSVP System.\n\n### Workflow:\n1. Use **Add Guest (Family)** or **Add Guest (Individual)** to create a guest entry. The response returns a unique, unguessable 12-character token and a formatted `rsvpLink`.\n2. The test script automatically saves `id` as `{{guestId}}` and `token` as `{{guestToken}}`.\n3. Send the `rsvpLink` to the guest (via WhatsApp, SMS, or QR code).\n4. The guest opens `https://domain.com/rsvp/{token}` to view their personalized card and submit attendance.\n5. You can update members or soft-disable invitations using the update/patch endpoints at any time.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Admin Guest Management",
      "description": "Endpoints used to create and manage wedding guests and families.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Add Guest (Family)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"guestId\", res.id);",
                  "}",
                  "if (res.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"guestToken\", res.token);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200/201\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"Returns 12-char secure token\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(res.token).to.have.lengthOf(12);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Sharma Family\",\n  \"type\": \"FAMILY\",\n  \"members\": [\n    \"Rajesh Sharma\",\n    \"Sunita Sharma\",\n    \"Rahul Sharma\"\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/guests",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "guests"]
            },
            "description": "Creates a family invitation with individual member names and auto-generates a 12-character random secure token."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Add Guest (Individual)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.id) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"guestId\", res.id);",
                  "if (res.token) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"guestToken\", res.token);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Dr. Ananya Verma\",\n  \"type\": \"INDIVIDUAL\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/guests",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "guests"]
            },
            "description": "Creates an individual invitation (without member list)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Add Guest (Custom Celebrations)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.id) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"guestId\", res.id);",
                  "if (res.token) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"guestToken\", res.token);",
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Gupta Family\",\n  \"type\": \"FAMILY\",\n  \"members\": [\n    \"Manoj Gupta\",\n    \"Kavita Gupta\"\n  ],\n  \"allowedEvents\": [\n    \"WEDDING\",\n    \"RECEPTION\"\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/guests",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "guests"]
            },
            "description": "Creates a guest invitation enabled ONLY for specific celebrations (e.g. Wedding and Reception only). Valid values: MEHENDI, HALDI, WEDDING, RECEPTION."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Guest by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/guests/{{guestId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "guests", "{{guestId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Retrieves the guest details, status, member list, and RSVP link for a specific guest ID."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List All Guests",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/guests",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "guests"]
            },
            "description": "Returns all registered guests and families, their RSVP status, and attending counts."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Guest",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Sharma Family\",\n  \"type\": \"FAMILY\",\n  \"members\": [\n    \"Rajesh Sharma\",\n    \"Sunita Sharma\"\n  ],\n  \"allowedEvents\": [\n    \"MEHENDI\",\n    \"HALDI\",\n    \"WEDDING\",\n    \"RECEPTION\"\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/guests/{{guestId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "guests", "{{guestId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Updates guest name, type, members, and allowed celebrations without changing the unique token."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Enable / Disable Celebrations (Toggle Events)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"allowedEvents\": [\n    \"WEDDING\",\n    \"RECEPTION\"\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/guests/{{guestId}}/events",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "guests", "{{guestId}}", "events"]
            },
            "description": "Enables or disables specific celebration events for this guest or family. Valid values: MEHENDI, HALDI, WEDDING, RECEPTION. Pass the array of celebrations to enable; any omitted celebrations will be hidden on their personalized website."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Disable Invitation (Soft Disable)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"INACTIVE\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/guests/{{guestId}}/status",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "guests", "{{guestId}}", "status"]
            },
            "description": "Soft disables an invitation so visitors cannot submit RSVPs with this link."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Enable Invitation (Reactivate)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"status\": \"ACTIVE\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/guests/{{guestId}}/status",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "guests", "{{guestId}}", "status"]
            },
            "description": "Reactivates an inactive invitation link."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Public Guest Flow (/rsvp/:token)",
      "description": "Public endpoints accessed by wedding guests via their token. Requires no login or database IDs.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Invitation by Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/rsvp/{{guestToken}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "rsvp", "{{guestToken}}"]
            },
            "description": "Fetches public greeting information, guest name, family members, and current RSVP status."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Submit RSVP (Joyfully Accept)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"rsvpStatus\": \"ATTENDING\",\n  \"attendingMembers\": [\n    \"Rajesh Sharma\",\n    \"Sunita Sharma\"\n  ],\n  \"message\": \"Heartiest congratulations Chandrika and Xudong! Wishing you a lifetime of joy and laughter together! ❤️\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/rsvp/{{guestToken}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "rsvp", "{{guestToken}}"]
            },
            "description": "Submits attendance confirmation, selection of attending members, and optional warm wishes for the couple."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Submit RSVP (Regretfully Decline)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"rsvpStatus\": \"NOT_ATTENDING\",\n  \"message\": \"Sending our warmest love and blessings to Chandrika and Xudong from afar!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/rsvp/{{guestToken}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "rsvp", "{{guestToken}}"]
            },
            "description": "Declines attendance with an optional blessing."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://weeding-test.onrender.com",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Set to https://weeding-test.onrender.com for live production, or http://localhost:8080 for local testing."
    },
    {
      "key": "guestId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "guestToken",
      "value": "7Kx92LmPq8Za",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ]
}
